CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/d/j com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/buildings/BuildQueueItem
	COMMENT Build-queue entry (a "Factory" item in the old mapping): synced unit-type/price/queue position with versioned (de)serialization. Holds the queued UnitTypeInterface, remaining count/time, price, tags, target point and target unit. Previously mis-mapped to Factory (collision). [evidence-based job name]
	FIELD a buildCount I
	FIELD b buildTime F
	FIELD c price Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;
	FIELD d streamingPrice Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;
	FIELD e tags Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/h;
	FIELD f PENDING_f Z
	FIELD g unitType Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/as;
	FIELD h rallyPoint Landroid/graphics/PointF;
	FIELD i PENDING_i Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
	FIELD j actionId Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/a/c;
	FIELD k PENDING_k Z
	FIELD l priority Z
	FIELD m progress F
	FIELD n paidAmount D
	METHOD a read (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/k;)V
